 exc:{t:'EX/C-1121 \u2014 Atlas Copco Mafi-Trench Turboexpander/Recompressor (Unit 1039, M2145)',d:['NAMEPLATE \u00B7 Atlas Copco Mafi-Trench Co. LLC, Santa Maria CA \u00B7 Unit No. 1039','Max power 3700 HP \u00B7 27,000 RPM \u00B7 flow 6,900,000 SCFH \u00B7 fluid: natural gas','EXPANDER: max 1100 psig \u00B7 temp \u2212150\u00B0F to 150\u00B0F','COMPRESSOR: max 675 psig \u00B7 temp \u221220\u00B0F to 225\u00B0F','Operating 88/151 MMSCFD \u00B7 ~2256/2188 HP \u00B7 IGVs (HIC-101) modulate load','Click to open the ACMTC 1039 controller / main screen']},
