 a1321:{t:'A-1321 \u2014 Expander/Compressor Discharge Cooler',d:['8,299 MBtu/hr (DESIGN) (corrected this session \u2014 previously written as 8,295) \u00B7 550 PSI DP @ -20/225\u00b0F \u00B7 (3) 40 HP fan motors','Vibration-monitored: VSHH-1321A/B/C (high-high switches) with VAHH-1321A/B/C alarms, one per fan, plus HS-1321A/B/C HAND-OFF-AUTO selectors and RUN indicators \u2014 confirmed real on the drawing (020185-AE-DW-M2145)']},
